Am I bad for this industry?
Are I really that bad for this industry?
Maybe the people here don't think so.
Maybe they need to take away my license and push me away, and there's no doubt that what I'm saying is going to give them material to think about.
But I've gotten to a point when I don't care anymore, and I'm sad about it.
It really made me sad.
I'll pressure them and carry a burden on them to make a decision.
I've got the support of my family and I can walk away.
